"description":"100 Million Hearts,  A Legacy Reborn!\n\nAuto turn-based battles, bold skill action, and the story of The Evan Expedition's adventure.\nThe original game has been reborn!\n\n≪ Game Introduction ≫\n\nDo you remember playing the original Seven Knights game with your friends?\nWelcome to Seven Knights Re:BIRTH: a game that will fill you with the same thrill and emotions. Featuring:\n\n▶ A [Refined Turn-Based Battle System]\nStrategically set your team formation and skill order, and you're ready to go!\nSit back and watch the battle unfold!\n\n▶ A [Bold Visual RPG] with the signature vibrance of the Seven Knights\nWatch charming heroes unleash their skills before you; from the beautiful Lunar Slash to the breathtaking Meteor Wrecker.\n\n▶ Experience diverse cinematics from the [Seven Knights Hero Story]\nSee the colorful heroes like never before in new animations and illustrations.\n\n▶ Play for FREE and farm Rubies to get opportunities to Summon [Daily Excitement]\nPlay to obtain Rubies and use them to summon heroes!\nEnter a world of sustainable hero collecting: a true collectible RPG!\n\n※ This app offer in-app purchases. You can disable this feature by adjusting your device’s settings.\nBy downloading this game, you are agreeing to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.\n - Terms of Use:  https://help.netmarble.com/en/terms/terms_of_service_en\n - Privacy Policy: https://help.netmarble.com/en/terms/privacy_policy_en", "bundleId":"com.netmarble.tskgb", "averageUserRating":4.8013700000000003598188413889147341251373291015625, "trackCensoredName":"Seven Knights Re:BIRTH", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/seven-knights-re-birth/id6479595079?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"12+", "userRatingCount":3801}]
